---
import { ArrowLeft, RefreshCw, Music2, Radio, Link, Film, Gamepad2, House, ShieldCheck, History, Plus, Save, Eye, Send } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hans"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><title>作品与推广 | Station Cat</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/admin-music.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/admin-station-content.css" /></head>
<body class="music-admin"><header class="music-topbar"><a href="/admin/music/"><ArrowLeft size={18} />返回音乐工作区</a><a href="/admin/music/media/">作品素材</a><a href="/admin/music/reports/">推广报表</a><span>Station Cat / 后台</span></header>
<main class="music-shell station-content-shell"><header class="music-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">作品与推广</p><h1>让作品，稳妥地被看见。</h1><p class="muted">整理网站资料与推广配置，核对后再公开。</p></div><span id="content-role" class="badge">正在核对角色</span></header>
<div class="music-feedback"><p id="content-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在连接内容服务。</p><button id="content-reload" type="button" aria-label="重新核对工作区"><RefreshCw size={18} /></button></div>
<div id="content-recovery" class="notice" hidden><span>有一项操作的结果尚未确认，已保留原版本和操作编号。</span><button id="content-retry" type="button">核对原操作</button></div>
<nav class="content-tabs" aria-label="内容模块">
{[['tracks',Music2,'歌曲资料'],['promotions',Radio,'推广歌曲'],['platforms',Link,'发行平台'],['clips',Film,'视频与 MV'],['games',Gamepad2,'游戏介绍'],['home',House,'首页配置'],['assets',ShieldCheck,'素材权利'],['audit',History,'发布记录']].map(([type,Icon,label])=><button type="button" data-module={type} aria-current={type==='tracks'?'page':undefined}><Icon size={17} />{label}</button>)}
</nav>
<div class="content-layout"><aside class="content-browser" aria-labelledby="content-list-heading"><header class="workspace-heading"><h2 id="content-list-heading">歌曲资料</h2><button id="content-new" type="button" aria-label="新建内容"><Plus size={18} /></button></header><label id="content-search-label">查找作品<input id="content-search" type="search" placeholder="标题或地址" maxlength="100" /></label><button id="content-search-submit" type="button">查找</button><ol id="content-list"><li class="muted">正在读取…</li></ol><button id="content-more" type="button" hidden>查看更早作品</button></aside>
<section class="music-workspace content-editor" aria-labelledby="content-editor-heading"><header class="workspace-heading"><div><h2 id="content-editor-heading">选择一份作品</h2><p id="content-version" class="muted">保存为草稿后，再核对公开内容。</p></div><span id="content-state" class="badge">草稿</span></header>
<div id="content-empty" class="content-empty"><Music2 size={32} /><p>在左侧选择作品，或新建网站资料。</p><p class="muted">网站公开、推广启用与平台发行分别设置。</p></div>
<form id="content-form" hidden><fieldset id="content-fields" disabled>
<div id="content-identity" class="field-grid"><label id="content-slug-wrap">作品地址名称<input id="content-slug" maxlength="100" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*" placeholder="例如 gentle-night" /></label><label id="content-parent-wrap">所属歌曲<select id="content-parent"><option value="">选择歌曲</option></select></label><label id="content-type-wrap">素材类型<select id="content-clip-type"><option value="short_video">歌曲短片</option><option value="mv">音乐 MV</option></select></label></div>
<section id="content-metadata" class="content-section"><h3>作品资料</h3><label>原文语言<select id="content-locale"><option value="zh-Hans">简体中文</option><option value="zh-Hant">繁體中文</option><option value="en">English</option><option value="ja">日本語</option></select></label><div class="field-grid">{[['zh-Hans','简体中文'],['zh-Hant','繁體中文'],['en','English'],['ja','日本語']].map(([locale,label])=><label>{label}标题<input data-title={locale} maxlength="200" /></label>)}</div><label id="content-artist-wrap">艺名<input id="content-artist" maxlength="120" /></label><details><summary>简介、故事与其他语言</summary><div class="field-grid">{[['zh-Hans','简体中文'],['zh-Hant','繁體中文'],['en','English'],['ja','日本語']].map(([locale,label])=><label>{label}简介<textarea data-summary={locale} maxlength="500" rows="3"></textarea></label>)}</div><label>作品介绍<textarea id="content-story" maxlength="8000" rows="5"></textarea></label><label id="content-related-wrap">相关歌曲<select id="content-related" multiple size="4"></select></label></details></section>
<section id="content-track-fields" class="content-section" hidden><h3>网站展示</h3><div class="field-grid"><label>封面<select id="content-cover"></select></label><label>歌词素材<select id="content-lyrics"></select></label><label>站内音频模式<select id="content-audio-mode"><option value="none">只展示作品资料</option><option value="preview">按推广配置提供试听</option><option value="free_full">引用现有免费完整资源</option><option value="existing_entitlement">引用现有权限完整资源</option></select></label><label>歌曲时长（秒）<input id="content-duration" type="number" min="0.001" max="86400" step="0.001" /></label></div><label>现有完整播放版本编号<input id="content-legacy" maxlength="36" placeholder="选用完整资源时填写现有封存版本" /></label><p class="notice">完整播放继续核对原有权益。公开试听在「推广歌曲」中单独设置。</p></section>
<section id="content-promotion-fields" class="content-section" hidden><h3>推广歌曲专门配置</h3><label class="content-check"><input id="content-promote" type="checkbox" />启用这首歌曲的推广</label><div class="field-grid"><label>主推排序<input id="content-sort" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" value="0" /></label><label class="content-check"><input id="content-preview-enable" type="checkbox" />提供独立公开试听</label></div><label>独立试听素材<select id="content-preview-asset"></select></label><p class="muted">关闭试听后不提供试听入口。保存未启用的推广版本会清除该版关联；下架保留封存历史。</p><div class="field-grid"><label>推广平台入口<select id="content-platform-ids" multiple size="4"></select></label><label>关联视频<select id="content-clip-ids" multiple size="4"></select></label></div><div id="content-campaigns" class="notice">正在读取推广链接与二维码。</div></section>
<section id="content-clip-fields" class="content-section" hidden><h3>视频素材</h3><div class="field-grid"><label>视频文件<select id="content-video"></select></label><label>封面海报<select id="content-poster"></select></label><label>视频时长（秒）<input id="content-clip-duration" type="number" min="0.001" max="1800" step="0.001" /></label></div><label>原文字幕<textarea id="content-subtitles" maxlength="2000" rows="4"></textarea></label><p class="notice">素材技术校验不能代替观看核对。发布前请确认画面、声音和使用范围。</p><details><summary>外部发布记录</summary><div id="content-publications"></div><div class="field-grid"><label>发布平台<select id="content-publication-channel"><option value="youtube">YouTube</option><option value="netease">网易云音乐</option><option value="qishui">汽水音乐</option></select></label><label>平台作品编号<input id="content-post-id" maxlength="200" /></label></div><label>真实发布网址<input id="content-post-url" type="url" maxlength="2048" /></label><label>已发布时间（新加坡 UTC+8）<input id="content-post-time" type="datetime-local" /></label><button id="content-add-publication" type="button">登记外部发布记录</button></details></section>
<section id="content-game-fields" class="content-section" hidden><h3>运行与设备</h3><label>游戏运行入口<select id="content-launch"><option value="">稍后确定</option><option value="/games/cat-life/">打工养猫日记 · 现有运行入口</option></select></label><div class="content-checks">{[['desktop','电脑浏览器'],['ios','iOS'],['android','Android']].map(([value,label])=><label class="content-check"><input data-device={value} type="checkbox" />{label}</label>)}</div><label>游戏截图<select id="content-screenshots" multiple size="4"></select></label><p class="muted">介绍页使用独立地址，已有游戏运行地址与存档服务保持稳定。</p></section>
<section id="content-home-fields" class="content-section" hidden><h3>首页展示</h3><div class="field-grid"><label>主推歌曲<select id="content-featured-track"></select></label><label>主推游戏<select id="content-featured-game"></select></label><label>精选歌曲（最多 3 首）<select id="content-selected-tracks" multiple size="4"></select></label><label>短视频（最多 4 条）<select id="content-selected-clips" multiple size="4"></select></label></div><p class="muted">首页只引用已公开且仍有效的推广作品。没有选择的区块保持空态。</p></section>
<label class="content-reason">本次操作说明<textarea id="content-reason" rows="2" maxlength="1000" placeholder="简短说明这次修改或公开的原因" required></textarea></label>
<footer class="music-actions"><button id="content-save" class="primary" type="submit"><Save size={17} />保存草稿</button><button id="content-preflight" type="button"><Eye size={17} />核对与预览</button><button id="content-publish" type="button"><Send size={17} />公开这一版</button><button id="content-unpublish" type="button">下架 / 停止推广</button></footer>
<details id="content-schedule-wrap"><summary>定时公开与版本回退</summary><label>定时公开（新加坡 UTC+8）<input id="content-due" type="datetime-local" /></label><div class="music-actions"><button id="content-schedule" type="button">安排定时公开</button><button id="content-cancel-schedule" type="button">取消定时</button></div><div id="content-jobs" class="notice"></div><label>已封存版本<select id="content-rollback-version"></select></label><button id="content-history-more" type="button" hidden>读取更早版本</button><button id="content-rollback" type="button">恢复所选版本并公开</button><p class="muted">恢复会产生新版本，并重新核对当前资源与权利。</p></details>
</fieldset></form>
<section id="content-platform-editor" hidden></section><section id="content-rights-editor" hidden></section><section id="content-audit" hidden></section>
<section id="content-preview" class="content-preview" hidden aria-label="私密资料预览"><header class="workspace-heading"><h3>这一版的资料预览</h3><select id="content-preview-width" aria-label="预览宽度"><option value="desktop">桌面</option><option value="mobile">窄屏</option></select></header><div id="content-preview-card"></div><p class="muted">仅供资料与窄屏排版核对；正式页面仍读取公开版本。</p></section>
</section></div></main><script>import '../../../../scripts/adminStationContent.js';</script></body></html>
